        which expects the Log to be computed between the Softmax and itself.
        Use `LogSoftmax` instead (it's faster and has better numerical properties).

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.Softmax(dim=1)
        >>> input = torch.randn(2, 3)
        >>> output = m(input)

